      "en": "Wisdom is supreme. Get wisdom. Yes, though it costs all your possessions, get understanding.",
      "ko": "지혜가 제일이니 지혜를 얻으라 무릇 너의 얻은 것을 가져 명철을 얻을찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "48337ea5487ea0504f279dc05b808e068707b00fe14721c994f680862c50984d",
      "translation_text_hash": "eb5b8ff79682978f3f98ab54c119e6654d36c76cf51eff144ff25ac7d8e81468",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
