      "en": "I have taught you in the way of wisdom. I have led you in straight paths.",
      "ko": "내가 지혜로운 길로 네게 가르쳤으며 정직한 첩경으로 너를 인도하였은즉",
      "source_text_hash": "f746bb59e09f3f9c3dea29b5fcb761d87dfef551a5c30d77b63e4d0146baf1c1",
      "translation_text_hash": "078a30c06249a95991769ad8468ced739ec649403e97c0637f822fa2dbf49263",
